Train &amp; Deploy XGBoost Model Step 1: Train Model Locally python train_model.py The script:
Loads all processed/YYYY.parquet files from S3. Drops rows with null values (insufficient history for rolling windows). Splits data chronologically — 70% Train / 30% Test (no shuffle to prevent data leakage). Trains XGBoostClassifier. Evaluates and exports training_report.md. Saves xgboost_model.json to the S3 Model Bucket. Training Results Metric Value Accuracy 53.12% Precision 0.5311 Recall 0.4828 F1 Score 0.5058 AUC-ROC 0.5487 Step 2: Deploy Lambda Predictor Function name: nasdaq-stock-predictor CMD override: src.lambda_stock_predictor.lambda_handler Memory: 2048 MB Timeout: 30 seconds The predictor returns:
